ntent":"You know, I'm pleasantly surprised by this forum avoiding an obvious joke that I will not go into, because I don't want to be a hypocrite.<br /> <br /> Instead, given how their modern descendants are now puppeteers of an entire vampiric Covenant in Tokyo? I think I've found the Hototogisu's theme:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XjW4_OlhKfo\" data-code=\"XjW4_OlhKfo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/XjW4_OlhKfo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T17:16:39-07:00","id":622850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/622019-six-compacts-and-conspiracies-from-the-edo-jidai?p=622449#post622449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was referring to Edo Japan.<br /> <br /> Though on the topic of female heads of state, give me 2 years to respond to that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironically, Japan is relatively known for its women warriors. Some play some historically significant roles, and were epic-level badasses. They weren't as common as men, but we have some monuments and things devoted to famous women samurai.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T17:19:04-07:00","id":622852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/622019-six-compacts-and-conspiracies-from-the-edo-jidai?p=622580#post622580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Something worth looking at is the <i>kakure kirishitan</i><br /> <br /> <i><b>Kakure Kirishitan</b> (\u96a0\u308c\u30ad\u30ea\u30b7\u30bf\u30f3<sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Installing_Japanese_character_sets\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#00e\">?</span></a></sup>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language\" target=\"_blank\">Japanese</a> for &quot;Hidden Christian&quot;) is a modern term for a member of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japan\" target=\"_blank\">Japanese</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catholic_Church\" target=\"_blank\">Catholic Church</a> during the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edo_period\" target=\"_blank\">Edo period</a> that went underground after the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shimabara_Rebellion\" target=\"_blank\">Shimabara Rebellion</a> in the 1630s.<sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kakure_Kirishitan#cite_note-enc-1\" target=\"_blank\">[1]</a></sup><sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kakure_Kirishitan#cite_note-d-2\" target=\"_blank\">[2]</a></sup> After the start of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakoku\" target=\"_blank\">Sakoku</a> period in 1639, it was officially prohibited from teaching the European <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catholic\" target=\"_blank\">Catholic</a> religion.</i><br /> <br /> It didn't fall completely apart and the Malleus may have more cells in Japan than one would expect.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's two reasons I didn't call them out here: <br /> <br /> a) I felt that I was already letting a little too much Western influence bleed in. That's an easy trap. <br /> <br /> b) It's a REALLY complicated topic. Like literally, numerous books were written on the topic. I don't feel like I could do them justice in a small space, and if I gave them enough attention, they'd start to take up disproportionate space in the material. <br /> <br /> There's clearly a parallel here. It's very intentional. But I wanted to infer it, not outright state it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T20:51:05-07:00","id":623067,"title":"","content":"I see Inoue continues to make himself a mystery by popping up<i> everywhere </i>as a different thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T23:54:11-07:00","id":623150,"title":"","content":"Whaaaat? The Kigo mark is only one day per Seitokuken dot now? *is sad*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T00:18:04-07:00","id":623155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/622019-six-compacts-and-conspiracies-from-the-edo-jidai?p=623150#post623150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whaaaat? The Kigo mark is only one day per Seitokuken dot now? *is sad*</div> </div> </div> </div>I am totally willing to reassess. What do people think? <br /> <br /> Honestly, I don't mind it being permanent until cut off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T01:17:14-07:00","id":623192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/622019-six-compacts-and-conspiracies-from-the-edo-jidai?p=623155#post623155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am totally willing to reassess. What do people think?<br /> <br /> Honestly, I don't mind it being permanent until cut off.</div> </div> </div> </div>I liked the possibility of stamping &quot;friend&quot; on your allies; it's not just enemies you might want to be able to find. Introducing a monster that already has a mark gives it interesting history from the get go. It limits your ability to use Kigo as part of a longer term strategy (following a minion back to their master, for example) if even the most powerful Otodo can't even get it to last a week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/815-kazorh","name":"Kazorh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar815_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T01:24:05-07:00","id":623193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kazorh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/622019-six-compacts-and-conspiracies-from-the-edo-jidai?p=623192#post623192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I liked the possibility of stamping &quot;friend&quot; on your allies; it's not just enemies you might want to be able to find. Introducing a monster that already has a mark gives it interesting history from the get go. It limits your ability to use Kigo as part of a longer term strategy (following a minion back to their master, for example) if even the most powerful Otodo can't even get it to last a week.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't disagree at all there. I did get a few comments saying they didn't like its lack of a duration. <br /> <br /> But fuck it. Unless I hear a really compelling argument to the contrary, it's going permanent until removed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"